WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.099 --> 00:00:05.399
If you for a moment believe that Donald Trump's
authoritarian tendencies were all fun and

00:00:05.399 --> 00:00:09.130
games, it is just become very, very real.

00:00:09.130 --> 00:00:14.370
As Donald Trump is now publicly threatening
to withhold money from Michigan if they decide

00:00:14.370 --> 00:00:18.990
to vote by mail and also threatening the state
of Nevada over vote by mail.

00:00:18.990 --> 00:00:25.170
So in the last three to four weeks, as Corona
virus has been raging, vote by mail logically

00:00:25.170 --> 00:00:26.460
has become a really big deal.

00:00:26.460 --> 00:00:29.270
When we think about we've got a presidential
election.

00:00:29.270 --> 00:00:33.130
We have thirty five Senate elections in November.

00:00:33.130 --> 00:00:39.280
When we think about people voting, when we
think about voter disenfranchisement, we immediately

00:00:39.280 --> 00:00:40.749
talk about vote by mail.

00:00:40.749 --> 00:00:43.739
And that's been a growing conversation for
the last month or so.

00:00:43.739 --> 00:00:47.719
Donald Trump doesn't want you to vote by mail
because he knows that if more people vote,

00:00:47.719 --> 00:00:49.079
it's very, very bad for him.

00:00:49.079 --> 00:00:50.079
That's it's plain and simple.

00:00:50.079 --> 00:00:53.289
I mean, we we can go into more about it, but
that's the story.

00:00:53.289 --> 00:00:56.129
Trump knows more people voting is not good
for him in November.

00:00:56.129 --> 00:01:01.100
He sees the polls and he knows he need any
voter suppression tactic he can get.

00:01:01.100 --> 00:01:05.160
He has couched it as vote by mail, makes fraud
easier.

00:01:05.160 --> 00:01:06.750
This is something we've debunked.

00:01:06.750 --> 00:01:10.590
250 million ballots have been cast by mail
in the last 20 years.

00:01:10.590 --> 00:01:17.850
On average, there are seven or eight individual
issues of vote by mail fraud per year.

00:01:17.850 --> 00:01:20.119
That's not seven or eight percent.

00:01:20.119 --> 00:01:22.119
That's not seven or eight per state.

00:01:22.119 --> 00:01:27.200
That's seven or eight issues per year nationally
with absentee ballots.

00:01:27.200 --> 00:01:30.790
It is statistically as close to zero as you
can get.

00:01:30.790 --> 00:01:37.070
Well, Donald Trump is now becoming an authoritarian
nightmare that we always feared he would be.

00:01:37.070 --> 00:01:43.240
When it comes to this issue, tweeting yesterday,
quote, Michigan sends absentee ballot applications

00:01:43.240 --> 00:01:48.380
to 7.7 million people ahead of primaries and
the general election.

00:01:48.380 --> 00:01:54.679
This was done illegally and without authorization
by a rogue secretary of state.

00:01:54.679 --> 00:01:59.650
I will ask to hold up funding to Michigan
if they want to go down this voter fraud path.

00:01:59.650 --> 00:02:02.409
Now, there's a couple really important things
to understand here.

00:02:02.409 --> 00:02:04.560
One is in the tweet.

00:02:04.560 --> 00:02:10.850
Trump says Michigan is doing something illegal
by sending absentee ballot applications.

00:02:10.850 --> 00:02:13.330
Earlier in the day, Trump tweeted.

00:02:13.330 --> 00:02:16.390
Michigan's doing something illegal by sending
people absentee ballots.

00:02:16.390 --> 00:02:18.720
Now, that's not what Michigan is doing.

00:02:18.720 --> 00:02:20.580
And the Michigan governor corrected him.

00:02:20.580 --> 00:02:24.270
Trump deleted the tweet, replaced it with
an identical, identical one that says it's

00:02:24.270 --> 00:02:28.790
illegal to send everybody an absentee ballot
application.

00:02:28.790 --> 00:02:30.380
Why do we care about that detail?

00:02:30.380 --> 00:02:34.420
The reason we care about it is because of
the rules that Michigan has now.

00:02:34.420 --> 00:02:37.460
I really want to be very clear about this.

00:02:37.460 --> 00:02:43.420
There would not be anything illegal in the
way Trump is claiming about sending everybody

00:02:43.420 --> 00:02:50.650
an absentee ballot, but it would go away,
go against Michigan's established rules for

00:02:50.650 --> 00:02:51.670
absentee ballots.

00:02:51.670 --> 00:02:55.100
The rules are you need to request one.

00:02:55.100 --> 00:02:57.540
You can't just be sent an absentee ballot.

00:02:57.540 --> 00:03:04.210
So importantly, Michigan is sending everybody
an application for an absentee ballot.

00:03:04.210 --> 00:03:07.010
They want to vote in person, presumably.

00:03:07.010 --> 00:03:12.140
But as far as the plan is right now, they
would still be able to do it if they don't

00:03:12.140 --> 00:03:13.240
want to vote in person.

00:03:13.240 --> 00:03:17.140
They can submit their request for an absentee
ballot and they would be sent one.

00:03:17.140 --> 00:03:19.190
There is nothing illegal about that.

00:03:19.190 --> 00:03:24.740
Now, Kaili McEnany, Trump's press secretary,
was asked multiple times during yesterday's

00:03:24.740 --> 00:03:25.970
press briefing.

00:03:25.970 --> 00:03:27.100
Trump used the word illegal.

00:03:27.100 --> 00:03:29.120
What exactly is the law that's being broken?

00:03:29.120 --> 00:03:32.940
She said, go talk to the Trump campaign, which,
of course, makes absolutely no, no, no sense

00:03:32.940 --> 00:03:33.940
at all.

00:03:33.940 --> 00:03:36.490
It's not just Michigan where Donald Trump
is doing this.

00:03:36.490 --> 00:03:38.380
Trump also tweeting about Nevada.

00:03:38.380 --> 00:03:44.690
Quote, State of Nevada thinks that they can
send out illegal vote by mail ballots, creating

00:03:44.690 --> 00:03:48.760
a voter fraud scenario for the state and the
U.S..

00:03:48.760 --> 00:03:49.760
They can't.

00:03:49.760 --> 00:03:54.430
If they do, I think I can hold up funds to
the state.

00:03:54.430 --> 00:03:58.040
Sorry, but you must not cheat in elections.

00:03:58.040 --> 00:03:59.300
This is not cheating.

00:03:59.300 --> 00:04:00.300
Okay.

00:04:00.300 --> 00:04:01.780
This is a ruse.

00:04:01.780 --> 00:04:09.900
And Donald Trump is creating a virulent sic
army of ignorant Trump ists who are just repeating

00:04:09.900 --> 00:04:12.160
these talking points without even understanding
them.

00:04:12.160 --> 00:04:14.220
It's illegal to do this.

00:04:14.220 --> 00:04:16.450
Vote by mail is a fraud.

00:04:16.450 --> 00:04:21.470
I really need people to understand the primary
crux of this story.

00:04:21.470 --> 00:04:23.250
We have states rights in this country.

00:04:23.250 --> 00:04:25.660
Listen to me sounding like a conservative.

00:04:25.660 --> 00:04:27.740
Trump touts federalism.

00:04:27.740 --> 00:04:29.460
Federalism means states rights.

00:04:29.460 --> 00:04:35.610
Federalism means anything that the federal
government doesn't specifically have a duty

00:04:35.610 --> 00:04:36.610
to do.

00:04:36.610 --> 00:04:42.830
The power to do it is by default the power
of the states to decide for themselves.

00:04:42.830 --> 00:04:47.110
We don't have one federal election in the
United States for president.

00:04:47.110 --> 00:04:48.870
We have a bunch of states.

00:04:48.870 --> 00:04:51.500
Each runs their own election.

00:04:51.500 --> 00:04:53.370
That's the constitution.

00:04:53.370 --> 00:04:54.510
That's federalism.

00:04:54.510 --> 00:04:59.420
There is nothing here that would allow the
federal government to dictate how a state.

00:04:59.420 --> 00:05:00.760
Runs their election.

00:05:00.760 --> 00:05:06.890
Now, if you have truly a constitutional issue
of disenfranchisement or something like that,

00:05:06.890 --> 00:05:10.410
you might see a case be appealed all the way
to the Supreme Court.

00:05:10.410 --> 00:05:13.580
But this is Trump's want to be dictator coming
out.

00:05:13.580 --> 00:05:17.720
Michigan allows for absentee voting for any
reason.

00:05:17.720 --> 00:05:22.200
Ever since 2018, that passed 66 with a 66
percent majority.

00:05:22.200 --> 00:05:23.800
It's in the state constitution.

00:05:23.800 --> 00:05:24.800
This is federalism.

00:05:24.800 --> 00:05:26.270
This is the law.

00:05:26.270 --> 00:05:28.300
Michigan is having major flood issues right
now.

00:05:28.300 --> 00:05:33.260
Trump is essentially threatening people's
lives by saying, I won't send you money if

00:05:33.260 --> 00:05:34.960
you do vote by mail.

00:05:34.960 --> 00:05:39.790
And that is, of course, a decision that Michigan
is 100 percent allowed to make outside the

00:05:39.790 --> 00:05:41.010
United States.

00:05:41.010 --> 00:05:42.190
They are watching this in horror.

00:05:42.190 --> 00:05:46.730
I got an e-mail from a viewer in Europe saying,
David, isn't this fascism? Trump is attacking

00:05:46.730 --> 00:05:50.970
the sovereignty of a state voting system that
is enshrined in federalism.

00:05:50.970 --> 00:05:55.440
They are allowed to make decisions about how
they will vote, what is happening to the United

00:05:55.440 --> 00:05:56.440
States.

00:05:56.440 --> 00:05:58.600
I wish I could tell you it is a tragedy.

00:05:58.600 --> 00:05:59.730
It is a nightmare.

00:05:59.730 --> 00:06:00.730
And I hate to say it.

00:06:00.730 --> 00:06:05.710
But once again, I don't know that Trump will
be held accountable for these threats in any

00:06:05.710 --> 00:06:22.169
way other than other than if we vote him out

00:06:22.169 --> 00:07:13.220
in November.

